Kept empty on purpose.
LVGL 9.2.2's env_support/cmake/esp.cmake passes this directory to
idf_component_register() as an include directory unconditionally, so it has to
exist even when LVGL's examples are not built - which is the case here:
sdkconfig.defaults sets CONFIG_LV_BUILD_EXAMPLES=n.
Not committed: 6.8 MB of example sources that nothing in this project compiles.
Take them from the LVGL 9.2.2 release if you ever want them.
